          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT 'ServerName'     AS MetricName, b.ServerName     AS MetricValue FROM [FileSizes].dbo.ScanBatch b WHERE b.BatchId IN (${batchid:singlequote})\r\nUNION ALL\r\nSELECT 'CollectedAtUtc' AS MetricName, CONVERT(VARCHAR, b.CollectedAtUtc, 120) FROM [FileSizes].dbo.ScanBatch b WHERE b.BatchId IN (${batchid:singlequote})\r\nUNION ALL\r\nSELECT 'ToolName'       AS MetricName, b.ToolName       FROM [FileSizes].dbo.ScanBatch b WHERE b.BatchId IN (${batchid:singlequote})\r\nUNION ALL\r\nSELECT 'CollectedBy'    AS MetricName, b.CollectedBy    FROM [FileSizes].dbo.ScanBatch b WHERE b.BatchId IN (${batchid:singlequote})\r\nUNION ALL\r\nSELECT 'Volumes'        AS MetricName, CAST(COUNT(v.ScanVolumeId) AS VARCHAR) FROM [FileSizes].dbo.ScanBatch b\r\nLEFT JOIN [FileSizes].dbo.ScanVolume v ON v.BatchId = b.BatchId\r\nWHERE b.BatchId IN (${batchid:singlequote})\r\nGROUP BY b.BatchId\r\nUNION ALL\r\nSELECT 'TotalEntries'   AS MetricName, CAST(SUM(v.EntryCount) AS VARCHAR) FROM [FileSizes].dbo.ScanBatch b\r\nLEFT JOIN [FileSizes].dbo.ScanVolume v ON v.BatchId = b.BatchId\r\nWHERE b.BatchId IN (${batchid:singlequote})\r\nGROUP BY b.BatchId;\r\n",
          "refId": "A",
          "sql": {
